  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to 30A Hideaway, an entire home located within The Hammocks of Seagrove Beach.<br><br>Need a last-minute stay? Please call our office directly to make last-minute bookings via telephone, as availability within the next 7-nights will not show on calendar. We do not allow online bookings within 7-nights/one week of an arrival date.<br><br>30% Discount off Spring Break and Spring Rates! 4-night minimum with flexible arrival/departure days. Valid on new bookings only for stays completed prior to May 22nd. Discount is reflected in online pricing.<br><br>30A Hideaway is a true departure from your typical 30A experience. Located in \"The Hammocks\", a private community off Hwy 395, you'll be nestled among oaks and magnolias. A large screened-in back porch offers a comfortable seat with nature views, perfect for relaxing after a day at the beach or a day shopping in the local 30A boutiques. The tranquility continues inside with a spacious open floor plan on the first level including a large living area, and a beautifully equipped kitchen and dining area. Comfortably sleeping 8 guests, each bedroom has its own private bathroom! The first floor King Master suite has a luxurious bathroom with a large soaking tub in a beautifully tiled shower. This home has the ideal layout for one or two families to join in the main living areas, but you still have your own private bedroom and bath to yourself. Pets are NOT allowed in 30A Hideaway.<br><br>ABOUT THE AREA: The Hammocks at Seagrove is a tranquil and quaint Seagrove Beach community, hidden in between Old Seagrove Beach and WaterColor. If you're looking for a secluded place to have an intermission in your busy lifestyle for an unforgettable vacation, The Hammocks at Seagrove is the first place to look. All homes in this community are created with modern, chic touches in similarity to that of the WaterColor community. The community offers two pools plus a nature trail which leads to a small dock and creek that flows into Western Lake. Should you want to leave your woodland nest, a short walk or bike ride will take you to many of the area's most popular destinations, including the closest Seagrove Beach public access, only 0.5 mile from the home. You're also centrally located to explore the neighboring communities of Seaside, WaterColor, and Grayton Beach.<br><br>Beach Access: The 395 Scenic Beach Access, located along Florida's beautiful 30A, is a peaceful getaway offering easy access to the Gulf of Mexico's emerald waters. This charming spot is nestled between coastal dunes and lush vegetation, with a wooden boardwalk leading you to soft, white sand beaches and gentle waves. For added convenience, the nearby Santa Clara Beach Access at 5311 E. County Hwy 30A provides restrooms and ample parking, making it an ideal spot for families and beachgoers. With stunning views, clear waters, and a tranquil atmosphere, the 395 and Santa Clara Beach Access areas offer the perfect coastal retreat.<br><br>Main Level: 1 Bedroom. 1 Bath. Powder Room. Kitchen. Dining Table seats up to 4. Kitchen island seats 4. Laundry Room. Back Screened Porch. Front Porch <br><br>#1 En-Suite Master King Bedroom, shower, soaking tub, pack-n-play.<br><br>Second Level: 3 Bedrooms. 3 Full Baths. <br><br>#2 En-Suite King Bedroom. <br>#3 En-Suite Queen Bedroom.<br>#4 En-Suite 2 Twin Bedroom (2 XL). <br><br>Amenities:<br><br>Business Features<br>Wireless Internet (password secured)<br><br>Entertainment Features<br>5 Roku Smart TV’s (no local cable, guests may use personal login credentials for streaming)<br><br>Distinctive Features<br>Gated community (no thru traffic)<br>2 private neighborhood pools<br>Bed, bath, and kitchen linens provided (no beach towels)<br>Beach Gear Credit<br><br>General Features<br>Parking for 2 vehicles<br>2 king beds, 1 queen bed, 2 XL twin beds<br>Pack-n-Play in #1 Bedroom closet<br>Security Camera facing driveway <br>4 Full bathrooms, powder room, iron, ironing board, hair dryer, outdoor grill w/grill utensils, screened outdoor, porch furniture.<br>Linens and bath towels provided. No Smoking. No Pets.<br>*Please note the home next door is currently under construction. <br><br>Kitchen Features<br>Fully equipped kitchen, Keurig + drip coffee maker, glass top electric induction range, refrigerator with ice maker, microwave, dishwasher, toaster, washer, dryer.<br><br>Area Features<br>Timpoochee Trail (30A bike path)<br>Grayton Beach (3 miles)<br>Seaside (1 mile)<br>State Parks (Tops’l, Grayton Beach, Deer Lake)<br><br>Beach Gear Credit<br>Get UP TO a $560 credit (based on length of stay) toward complementary Beach Gear when you book a Grayt 30A Vacations home! Your gear must be ordered NO LATER THAN 48 hours prior to your arrival date and will be delivered to your home on the day of your arrival. Browse and select available gear online, including bikes, umbrellas, and beach loungers. Please note - some neighborhoods have restrictions on beach chairs/umbrella set-ups; check with us first, so your credit may be utilized for other items.<br><br>Grayt 30A Vacations is a locally owned, 30A based management company, a Vrbo Premier Host and the 2023, 2024, 2025 and 2026 Winner of the Perfect in Walton County award for Best Boutique Vacation Rental Company...Hospitality Lives Here!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
